# The portfolio deploys from the repository root with vercel.json
# "outputDirectory": ".", so every uploaded file is served on the live site.
# Upload only the site itself: ignore everything at the top level, then allow
# the site's own files back. Anything new at the top level stays private
# until it is added here. tests/test_deploy.py checks this list.
#
# The blog and the CMS admin deploy from their own folders (blog/,
# cms/frontend/), so this file does not affect them.
/*
!index.html
!404.html
!css
!js
!assets
!admin
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!vercel.json

# Never upload these, even inside an allowed folder.
*.md
*.log
*.map
.env*
.DS_Store

# Licences of bundled third-party code ship with it.
!assets/vendor/*LICENSE*
